## Typography

### Font System
- Use system fonts or web fonts
- Limit font families (2-3 max)
- Proper font weights
- Readable line heights
- Appropriate font sizes

### Text Hierarchy
- Clear heading hierarchy
- Consistent text styles
- Proper text alignment
- Readable line lengths (50-75 characters)

## Spacing and Layout

### Consistent Spacing
- Use design token spacing scale
- Consistent margins and padding
- Proper whitespace
- Grid-based layouts

### Layout Patterns
- Use CSS Grid for complex layouts
- Use Flexbox for component layouts
- Consistent container widths
- Proper content max-widths

## Collaboration

- Work with Frontend Expert for component implementation
- Coordinate with Performance Expert for optimization
- Ensure all components are accessible
- Maintain design system documentation
